  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-07-25T17:29:58.862Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "With the recently added skeletal input system, controller users now have a much wider estimated splay than before. This wasn't accounted for on many avatars, and fingers can frequently end up looking broken.\n\nA new option to adjust this splay on a per-avatar basis should be added. 0% would be the finger splay prior to the open beta, and 100% would be how the splay is now. Users would be able to finely adjust between these values based on preference.",
